25,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It seems we often fail when we ask too much of everyone. Narrow, specialized tools tend to survive better than broad ones.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The capital budget is frozen, but we have some room in the software allowance. However, per-head licenses might be expensive.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Oh no! The network at plants is terrible, and our developers are busy until the third quarter. This is a problem!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"We are losing an hour a day just copying records. Also, misrouted deliveries are happening because of inconsistent addresses.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The coordination group is understaffed, and clerks are wasting time asking for the same certificates repeatedly.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Ryuji, your findings on record duplication align with the need for a focused solution.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Sakura, if the developers are busy, can we even start a new project?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Sakura,,I don't know! Maybe a vendor can help? But @Daisuke said licenses are pricey!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,The data inconsistency is a concrete loss. We should prioritize fixing the root cause of these errors.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Asuka,,We cannot ignore the human cost. Any proposal that adds more manual reporting to the coordination group is a mistake.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Servas,,"We must avoid the trap of ""grand visions"" that no one actually uses daily.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'm worried about the long-term costs. Fixed-fee work seems safer than licenses.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Sakura,,But we need something that actually works in the field!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,Efficiency on the floor is the only metric that matters.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"Agreed. We need to reduce the administrative burden, not increase it.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
